# Hardware: Ryzen 7 5700U (8C/16T, Zen 2, AVX2) · 14Gi RAM · no GPU
# | Resource | Budget |
# |---|---|
# | 8B model inference (mmap) | ~6Gi |
# | 4B model | ~4Gi |
# | 1.7B model | ~2Gi |
# | 0.6B model / Iris spec-decode | ~1Gi |
# | Podman containers (~5) | ~2.3Gi |
# | OS + services | ~2Gi |
# | Safety reserve | ~1Gi |
# Rules: never load more than ONE model >= 4B at a time · `ResourceGuard` (Semaphore(1)) is final ·
#   on OOM stop inference, checkpoint, release containers · never swap to disk.
# Note: a Dev Invariant exists (Makali, 2026-09-19) — no local model calls during engine
#   development (`verification.enabled=false` disables the SkepticalVerifier's model call).
#
# ## CODING STANDARDS
# - Async: `anyio` ONLY; blocking I/O via `anyio.to_thread.run_sync`; no `asyncio` (M1)
# - Config: YAML for entity/model config; never PostgreSQL for entity state
# - Packages: always `.venv`; never `--break-system-packages` (M24)
# - Types: Python 3.12+ syntax (no `from __future__`); typed errors, no bare `except:`
# - Heritage: `[id-soft: GAME YEAR]` inline tag for every ported id Software pattern (M14)
# - Writes: atomic `.tmp` → rename for any file mutation (M12)
# - Docs: reference docs must pass `make doc-llm-validate` (M26); new markdown needs SPDX headers
#   (`SPDX-FileCopyrightText` + `SPDX-License-Identifier`) or REUSE v3.3 CI fails — and remember the
#   `*.md` gitignore trap: verify with `git ls-files --error-unmatch <file>`
# - Tests: `pytest.raises(OmegaError)`; contract tests for typed returns (M21)
#
