# - Do not `import asyncio` in `src/omega/` (M1); do not put stack logic in Core (M2).
# - Do not construct Redis unless `OMEGA_REDIS_HOST` is set.
# - Do not use `--break-system-packages` (M24).
# - Do not synthesize a result when a mandatory tool is broken (M23 -> `[TOOL-CHAIN-COLLAPSE]`).
# - Do not assign entities to slots unless proven (M10) — today only **S3 -> carmack**.
# - Do not quote `make temple-grade` as proof (decorative) or any phantom `make`/`omega` verb.
# - Do not use "Node" for a domain — that word is federation topology (Node 0 / Node 1).
